From 5aa848c4e154807a9aa37c3ce2cfa9761159af59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ghajarvpn Build <build@ghajarvpn.local>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 12:19:08 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(openvpn): full profile management in the Ghajar server
 list

Keep imported OVPN profiles listed in a dedicated OpenVPN card with
connect/disconnect, live engine state, pre-connect ping toast,
credential editing and delete. OVPN files offered through the normal
import path route to the bridge, and saved profiles reconnect without
re-import. Status flows straight from VpnStatus so connection and error
states stay honest.
